<title>SWEDEN: Rottneros says to increase pulp price.</title>
<headline>Rottneros says to increase pulp price.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish pulp producer Rottneros said it will follow other producers and increase pulp prices to $580 per tonne.</p>
<p>Rottneros Managing Director Jaroslav Havlicek told a board meeting: &quot;The price increases recently announced by several American and Scandinavian pulp producers for May to $580 per tonne should have a better chance of success than the four earlier attempts.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
